Package: k8init
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: krb5-config
Description: Web service for users to change their own Kerberos password
 k8init serves a web form that lets users change their own Kerberos
 password. It works with MIT krb5, Heimdal and Active Directory/Samba
 KDCs, and reads realms and KDCs from /etc/krb5.conf.
 .
 The service listens on localhost by default. Edit /etc/default/k8init
 to enable TLS or change the listening address.
